"a, b, c" Enter         # <pick>
Enter*2                 # pick:/1 pick:
Enter*6                 # [1]/-1 [1]/-2 [2]/-1 [2]/-2 [3]/-1 [3]/-2
Enter                   # /1
Up Up*23 Esc "e"        # at /2, review to the pick: Begin and ask again
Backspace*20 "c, a" Enter
Enter*2                 # pick:/1 pick:
Enter*4                 # [1]/-1 [1]/-2 [2]/-1 [2]/-2
Enter*3                 # /1 /2 survey:
--- resume
Up*3 Esc "f" "gone" Enter  # review past /1 to the last iteration standing and fail it
Enter*2                 # /1 survey:
